    ('2f000000-0000-4000-8000-040000000061', '2f000000-0000-4000-8000-030000000061', 1, 'How do plants on a roof cool the air?', '[{"optionKey":"A","content":"They give shade at night","sortOrder":1},{"optionKey":"B","content":"Water evaporating from the leaves cools the air","sortOrder":2},{"optionKey":"C","content":"They reflect sunlight into space","sortOrder":3}]'::jsonb, '{"type":"CHOICE","correct":"B"}'::jsonb, 1, 'Bước 1 · Hiểu câu hỏi
