Bước 4 · Đáp án
B: No one sees another customer served first', 'PUBLISHED'),
    ('2f000000-0000-4000-8000-040000000070', '2f000000-0000-4000-8000-030000000070', 1, 'What does the theme park do?', '[{"optionKey":"A","content":"It posts a waiting time longer than the real one","sortOrder":1},{"optionKey":"B","content":"It closes rides at busy times","sortOrder":2},{"optionKey":"C","content":"It offers free drinks","sortOrder":3}]'::jsonb, '{"type":"CHOICE","correct":"A"}'::jsonb, 1, 'Bước 1 · Hiểu câu hỏi
