complaints', 'PUBLISHED'),
    ('2f000000-0000-4000-8000-040000000072', '2f000000-0000-4000-8000-030000000072', 1, 'A better test of a business is whether it also works to shorten the queue ______.', NULL, '{"type":"FILL","accepted":["itself"]}'::jsonb, 1, 'Bước 1 · Hiểu câu hỏi
